text = "Notice

You

You are a salvage diver who lost everything when the harbor flooded. Your debts are due, and your boat is gone. One night, an old sailor hands you a rusted map of Harbor Tower and says one thing: “The compass will save you, but the tower won’t let you leave without paying its toll.”

You walk in, and the doors lock behind you."

